#: /vhome/ckvsoft/ckvsoft.at/service/cevian/core_modules/home/view/home.php:13
msgid ""
"Only the files you want to modify should be saved within the /modules "
"directory, and they must be in the exact same path as they are in the "
"core_modules directory. This \"mirroring\" path ensures your customized "
"files seamlessly override the originals."
